    {
      "id": "character.hatsune-miku",
      "aliases": [
        "初音ミク",
        "初音未來",
        "Hatsune Miku",
        "Miku"
      ],
      "creators": [
        "Crypton Future Media"
      ],
      "kind": "character",
      "content": {
        "zh-Hant": "初音未來是 Crypton Future Media 開發的虛擬歌手軟體角色；官方設定為 16 歲、158 cm、42 kg，聲源由藤田咲提供。",
        "en": "Hatsune Miku is a virtual singer software character developed by Crypton Future Media. Her official profile lists age 16, height 158 cm, weight 42 kg, with voice samples by Saki Fujita.",
        "ja": "初音ミクはクリプトン・フューチャー・メディアが開発したバーチャル・シンガー・ソフトウェアのキャラクター。公式プロフィールは16歳、158 cm、42 kgで、声の元は藤田咲さんです。"
      },
      "sourceURL": "https://piapro.net/intl/en_character.html",
      "featured": false,
      "sourceStatus": "bundled"
    },
    {
      "id": "character.snow-miku",
      "aliases": [
        "雪ミク",
        "雪未來",
        "Snow Miku"
      ],
      "creators": [
        "Crypton Future Media"
      ],
      "kind": "character",
      "content": {
        "zh-Hant": "雪未來是為北海道加油的角色，源自札幌雪祭的白色初音未來雪像，並成為每年 SNOW MIKU 節慶的主角。",
        "en": "Snow Miku is a character who supports Hokkaido. She was inspired by a white Hatsune Miku snow sculpture at the Sapporo Snow Festival and leads the annual SNOW MIKU festival.",
        "ja": "雪ミクは北海道を応援するキャラクター。さっぽろ雪まつりの真っ白な初音ミク雪像をきっかけに誕生し、毎年の「SNOW MIKU」フェスティバルで主役を務めています。"
      },
      "sourceURL": "https://snowmiku.com/about.html",
      "featured": false,
      "sourceStatus": "bundled"
    },
    {
      "id": "performance.magical-mirai",
      "aliases": [
        "マジカルミライ",
        "Magical Mirai",
        "魔法未來"
      ],
      "creators": [
        "Crypton Future Media",
        "TOKYO MX"
      ],
      "kind": "performance",
      "content": {
        "zh-Hant": "「魔法未來」是結合初音未來等虛擬歌手 3DCG 現場演出，以及讓參加者體驗創作樂趣之企劃展的活動。",
        "en": "Magical Mirai combines a 3DCG live show by Hatsune Miku and the other virtual singers with an exhibition where visitors can experience the joy of creativity.",
        "ja": "「マジカルミライ」は、初音ミクたちバーチャル・シンガーの3DCGライブと、創作の楽しさを体感できる企画展を併催するイベントです。"
      },
      "sourceURL": "https://magicalmirai.com/",
      "featured": false,
      "sourceStatus": "bundled"
    },
    {
      "id": "performance.snow-miku",
      "aliases": [
        "SNOW MIKU",
        "SNOW MIKU Festival",
        "雪ミク祭典"
      ],
      "creators": [
        "Crypton Future Media"
      ],
      "kind": "performance",
      "content": {
        "zh-Hant": "「SNOW MIKU」是以雪未來為主角、為冬季北海道加油的節慶，每年在北海道舉行。",
        "en": "SNOW MIKU is an annual festival in Hokkaido led by Snow Miku to support the region in winter.",
        "ja": "「SNOW MIKU」は、雪ミクが主役となって冬の北海道を応援する、北海道で毎年開催されるフェスティバルです。"
      },
      "sourceURL": "https://snowmiku.com/",
